        "original_id": "8a583b11-3795-5329-b181-6679a7f1b62d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gabe Turner, Kevin Spacey, Meryl Streep, Arnold Schwarzenegger, David Beckham, James Corden, Billy Crystal\n- Roles: Producer, Director, Writer, Actor\n- Works: The Usual Suspects, American Beauty, The Guvnors\n- Topics: TV and film collaborations, Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- In the early 1990s, Kevin Spacey gained critical acclaim that led to an Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for The Usual Suspects (1995).\n- In 1999, Kevin Spacey won the Academy Award for Best Actor for American Beauty.\n- In 2014, Gabe Turner directed the film The Guvnors.\n- Gabe Turner has worked as a producer, director, and writer on TV and film projects.\n- Gabe Turner has regularly collaborated on projects featuring Meryl Streep, Arnold Schwarzenegger, David Beckham, James Corden, Billy Crystal, and Kevin Spacey.",
